ch-stranding spread. Another suggests the boats are practice equipment for young orcas learning to hunt. What nobody has found is any sign that it's aimed at the people on board. Which is reassuring, and also a slightly strange thing to find reassuring.", "model_id": "eleven_v3", "voice_id": "bIHbv24MWmeRgasZH58o", "audio_bytes": 514550}